---
// One pass through uv_run(), drawn as a closed ring: 1-6 across the top and
// back along the bottom, the liveness gate on the return path, the one-off
// timer pass before the loop, and the startup row that leads into uv_run(). The column on the right is everything outside
// libuv on the same thread: Node's C++ glue, V8, your callback, and the
// nextTick and promise queues drained after it. Click a step for details, or
// trace a path with the buttons.
---

<div class="uv-loop" data-uv-loop>
  <figure class="uv-loop__figure">
    <div class="uv-loop__scroll">
      <svg class="uv-loop__svg" role="group" viewBox="196 -136 816 616" lang="en" aria-labelledby="uv-loop-title uv-loop-desc">
        <title id="uv-loop-title">One pass through uv_run(), and what it calls into</title>
        <desc id="uv-loop-desc">At startup, Node boots V8 and the libuv loop, V8 runs the main script to the end, and Node drains the nextTick and promise queues before calling uv_run(). Before the loop, due timers run once. Then the six steps of one uv_run() pass, numbered 1 to 6: pending callbacks, idle and prepare, poll, check, close callbacks, timers. The uv__loop_alive() gate on the return path either starts another pass or returns. Outside libuv, on the same thread: when a phase has a callback, libuv calls Node's C++ glue, Node enters V8, and V8 runs your JavaScript. When it returns, Node drains the process.nextTick queue, then V8's Promise microtasks, and control goes back to the loop. Async API calls go the other way, from Node down to libuv.</desc>
        <defs>
          <marker id="uv-loop-arrowhead" markerWidth="10" markerHeight="7" refX="9" refY="3.5" orient="auto">
            <polygon points="0 0, 10 3.5, 0 7" class="m-default" />
          </marker>
        </defs>

        <!-- Lanes -->
        <rect x="212" y="-124" width="540" height="82" class="c-strip" stroke-width="1" />
        <text x="226" y="-108" class="t-muted" font-size="9" font-weight="600">startup · once</text>
        <rect x="212" y="52" width="540" height="346" class="c-lane" stroke-width="1" />
        <text x="226" y="74" class="t-muted" font-size="10" font-weight="600">while loop</text>
        <rect x="820" y="30" width="176" height="442" class="c-strip" stroke-width="1" />
        <text x="836" y="48" class="t-muted" font-size="9" font-weight="600">outside libuv · same thread</text>

        <!-- Edges -->
        <path data-edge-from="boot" data-edge-to="main" d="M 392.6 -76 L 432.6 -76" class="a-default" stroke-width="1.4" marker-end="url(#uv-loop-arrowhead)" />
        <path data-edge-from="main" data-edge-to="drain" d="M 572.6 -76 L 612.6 -76" class="a-default" stroke-width="1.4" marker-end="url(#uv-loop-arrowhead)" />
        <path data-edge-from="drain" data-edge-to="start" d="M 672.6 -54 L 672.6 11 L 392.6 11" class="a-default" stroke-width="1.4" marker-end="url(#uv-loop-arrowhead)" />
        <path data-edge-from="start" data-edge-to="pending" d="M 322.6 36 L 322.6 86" class="a-default" stroke-width="1.4" marker-end="url(#uv-loop-arrowhead)" />
